// BranchedFoldingUtils.kt: isEqualTo → semanticallyEquals, isSubTypeOf → isSubtypeOf in Analysis API 2.3.21. // These are extension functions on KaType in KaSession context. [file: 'org/jetbrains/kotlin/idea/k2/refactoring/util/BranchedFoldingUtils.kt', old: 'return nonNullableRightTypeOfFirst.isEqualTo(nonNullableRightTypeOfSecond) ||
